{"id":"e3639c5e689e29d7","group":"92","path":"92/92-df-recursive-extension.md","title":"Recursive Extension","display":"df-recursive-extension — Recursive Extension","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-df-recursive-extension","aliases":["92-df-recursive-extension"],"display":"df-recursive-extension — Recursive Extension","depends_on":["[[92-df-sentence]]","[[92-df-recursive-axiomatization]]","[[92-df-theory]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-df-recursive-extension"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-df-recursive-extension</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-recursive-extension — Recursive Extension"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"90f32e29c9d553ed\" href=\"?note=90f32e29c9d553ed\" title=\"92-df-sentence\">92-df-sentence</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"2f9850d6fe4ddc35\" href=\"?note=2f9850d6fe4ddc35\" title=\"92-df-recursive-axiomatization\">92-df-recursive-axiomatization</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"87dbd27955ecb3b6\" href=\"?note=87dbd27955ecb3b6\" title=\"92-df-theory\">92-df-theory</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T,T&#39;\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_G\">\\(T,T&#39;\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_G\\)</span> (theories, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"90f32e29c9d553ed\" href=\"?note=90f32e29c9d553ed\" title=\"92-df-sentence\">92-df-sentence</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Theory}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Theory}_G\\)</span> (closed-theory predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"87dbd27955ecb3b6\" href=\"?note=87dbd27955ecb3b6\" title=\"92-df-theory\">92-df-theory</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RecAx}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{RecAx}_G\\)</span> (recursive-axiomatization predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"2f9850d6fe4ddc35\" href=\"?note=2f9850d6fe4ddc35\" title=\"92-df-recursive-axiomatization\">92-df-recursive-axiomatization</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RecExt}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{RecExt}_G\\)</span> (definition-target recursive-extension relation)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}recursive\\text{-}extension} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{RecExt}_G(T&#39;,T)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Theory}_G(T)\\land\\mathrm{Theory}_G(T&#39;)\\land T\\subseteq T&#39;\\land\\mathrm{RecAx}_G(T&#39;)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}recursive\\text{-}extension} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{RecExt}_G(T&#39;,T)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Theory}_G(T)\\land\\mathrm{Theory}_G(T&#39;)\\land T\\subseteq T&#39;\\land\\mathrm{RecAx}_G(T&#39;)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RecExt}(\\mathcal{F}&#39;, \\mathcal{F})\">\\(\\mathrm{RecExt}(\\mathcal{F}&#39;, \\mathcal{F})\\)</span> : <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{F}&#39;\">\\(\\mathcal{F}&#39;\\)</span>是<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal{F}\">\\(\\mathcal{F}\\)</span>的递归扩展</li>\n<li>该定义只要求扩张理论<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T&#39;\">\\(T&#39;\\)</span>存在某个递归公理化；它不推出差集<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T&#39;\\setminus T\">\\(T&#39;\\setminus T\\)</span>或某个特定“新添加公理集”可判定</li>\n<li>本质不完备性只对具有相应性质的基理论成立：若<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span>能解释足够算术，则每个相容、有效可公理化的扩张<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T&#39;\">\\(T&#39;\\)</span>不完备</li>\n<li>对不具备足够算术强度的理论，递归且完备的扩张可能存在，不能无条件宣称“添加递归公理永远不能完备化”</li>\n<li>这是本质不完备性定理的条件</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"90f32e29c9d553ed","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-sentence]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-recursive-axiomatization","status":"resolved","id":"2f9850d6fe4ddc35","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-recursive-axiomatization]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-theory","status":"resolved","id":"87dbd27955ecb3b6","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-theory]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-sentence","status":"resolved","id":"90f32e29c9d553ed","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$T,T'\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_G$ (theories, see [[92-df-sentence]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-theory","status":"resolved","id":"87dbd27955ecb3b6","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Theory}_G$ (closed-theory predicate, see [[92-df-theory]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-recursive-axiomatization","status":"resolved","id":"2f9850d6fe4ddc35","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{RecAx}_G$ (recursive-axiomatization predicate, see [[92-df-recursive-axiomatization]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"T,T'\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Theory}_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RecAx}_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RecExt}_G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}recursive\\text{-}extension} \\vdash\n\\mathrm{RecExt}_G(T',T)\\Longle